==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (3,000%) spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**8 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though the rest of the stage is not too threatening, the two Fallen Bears warrant a good anti-Aku answer to them, whether it be a Shield Pierce unit or a high DPS anti-Aku.

